* MC7812 model bench: Vin ramps 14 -> 10 V, 120 ohm (0.1 A) and 50 ohm loads
V1 IN 0 PWL(0 14 1m 14 9m 10 10m 10)
X1 IN O1 0 MC7812_TYP
R1 O1 0 120
C1 O1 0 47u
X2 IN O2 0 MC7812_WC
R2 O2 0 120
C2 O2 0 47u
X3 IN O3 0 MC7812_TYP
R3 O3 0 12
X4 IN O4 0 LM2940_12
R4 O4 0 120
C4 O4 0 47u
.lib MC7812.lib
.lib LM2940_12.lib
.tran 10m
.meas TRAN o1_14 FIND V(O1) AT 0.9m
.meas TRAN o1_12 FIND V(O1) WHEN V(IN)=12 FALL=1
.meas TRAN o2_12 FIND V(O2) WHEN V(IN)=12 FALL=1
.meas TRAN o3_12 FIND V(O3) WHEN V(IN)=12 FALL=1
.meas TRAN o4_12 FIND V(O4) WHEN V(IN)=12 FALL=1
.meas TRAN o1_11 FIND V(O1) WHEN V(IN)=11 FALL=1
.meas TRAN o2_11 FIND V(O2) WHEN V(IN)=11 FALL=1
.meas TRAN o4_11 FIND V(O4) WHEN V(IN)=11 FALL=1
.meas TRAN iin14 FIND I(V1) AT 0.9m
.end
